---
layout: base.njk
title: FAQ
permalink: /faq/
description: Les vraies questions sur Studio On et le Pilates Reformer.
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <span class="page-hero__kicker">FAQ</span>
  <h1 class="page-hero__h">Les vraies<br><em>questions.</em></h1>
  <p class="page-hero__p">Si ta question n'y est pas, écris-nous, on y répond très vite&nbsp;!</p>
</section>

<section class="reveal">
  <div class="faq">
    {% for item in faq.list %}
    <details{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
      <summary>{{ item.q | safe }}</summary>
      <div class="faq__body">{{ item.a | safe }}</div>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band reveal">
  <h2 class="cta-band__h">Une autre<br>question&nbsp;?</h2>
  <div class="cta-band__side">
    <p class="cta-band__p" style="color: var(--vanille); opacity: 1;">Écris-nous, on répond vite.</p>
    <div class="cta-band__actions">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--ecru">Nous écrire <span class="btn__toggle"></span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
